==================================Game Summary==============================
A simple barebones snake game with code framework for keybinding.  


==================================Credits ==================================
Sprites found from google and modified into atlas by me.  
Apple sprite: https://rembound.com/articles/creating-a-snake-game-tutorial-with-html5
Snake sprites: https://www.pixilart.com/art/snake-sprite-sr25de9bcd852e6

==================================Controls==================================
By default the keybinds are WASD for movememnt, mouse left click for boost and escape key for quitting the program.
Default keybinds can be changed in PlayerInput.cs
Delayed auto shift (DAS) functionality carried over from another project.  Simply repeats the key's execution once held after a certain amount of time.  DAS delay is data driven.

==================================AI Use====================================
AI was used in fixing syntax issues from converting old keybind code written in C and generating the blueprint for atlasdefinition.xml file.